{"id":"H3109","lemma":"יוֹחָא","transliteration":"yoach","sayIt":"yo-ach","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Joha","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.16;\nson of: Beriah (H1283I);\nbrother of: Arad (H6166B), Ahio (H0283H), Shashak (H8349), Jeremoth (H3406I), Zebadiah (H2069), Eder (H5738), Michael (H4317L) and Ishpah (H3472)\n§ Joha = \"Jehovah gives life\"\n1) one of the sons of Beriah the Benjamite\n2) the Tizite, one of David's mighty warriors","glosses":["joha"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Joha","kjv":"and Joha"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joha","kjv":"and Joha"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:16","note":"Michael, Ishpah, Joha, the sons of Beriah,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H2069","lemma":"זְבַדְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zevadyah","gloss":"Zebadiah"},{"id":"H3043","lemma":"יְדִיעֲאֵל","transliteration":"yediael","gloss":"Jediael"},{"id":"H6166","lemma":"עֲרָד","transliteration":"arad","gloss":"Arad"},{"id":"H8349","lemma":"שָׁשָׁק","transliteration":"shashaq","gloss":"Shashak"},{"id":"H3406","lemma":"יְרִימוֹת","transliteration":"yerimot","gloss":"Jerimoth"},{"id":"H5738","lemma":"עֶ֫דֶר","transliteration":"eder","gloss":"Eder"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3109H","gloss":"Joha","relation":"H3109H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}